      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COBBLERS RUN (4) had second look this course and distance latest and improved on her time, finishing a nose second in 19.91. Expected to push the clock again here. ACE'S ELITE (7) is a first starter from the Travis Elson kennel by Fernando Bale out of All Aces. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Respect any strong moves in the market. BACKFLIP BOY (1) is still a maiden after 13 runs but rarely far away, the latest finishing out of the placings when fourth at this track. Has ability and can atone. DODGEM MOCHA (8) was in the money last start and wasn't beaten far - should feature again.",
